		font-weight: 500;
	}

	.submit-btn {
		height: 52px;
		background-color: #007AFF;
		border-radius: 26px;
		justify-content: center;
		align-items: center;
		width: 100%;
	}

	.wechat-btn {
		background-color: #07C160;
	}

	.submit-text {
		color: #FFFFFF;
