		font-weight: 600;
		text-align: center;
	}

	.apple-login-container {
		margin-top: 24px;
		height: 52px;
		background-color: #000000;
		border-radius: 26px;
		flex-direction: row;
		justify-content: center;
		align-items: center;
		width: 100%;
	}

	.wechat-form {
		align-items: center;
	}

	.wechat-desc {
		font-size: 14px;
